{"seq":3,"slug":"clocks-and-ordering","title":"分布式时钟与排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/fundamentals/clocks-and-ordering","wordCount":1260,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"分布式时钟与排序\">分布式时钟与排序</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>在分布式系统中，不存在全局统一的物理时钟。由于网络延迟和时钟漂移，不同节点无法精确同步时间。逻辑时钟（Lamport 时钟、向量时钟）和混合逻辑时钟为事件排序提供了可靠的解决方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本主题围绕&quot;如何在无全局时钟的系统中给事件排序&quot;展开，四个概念是理解后续所有方案的钥匙：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>物理时钟不可信</strong>：晶振漂移、NTP 跳变、网络延迟不确定，三者叠加使跨节点的物理时间戳无法可靠判定先后。</li>\n<li><strong>happens-before 关系</strong>：Lamport 定义的因果偏序——同进程内的事件有序，消息发送先于接收，并沿链条传递；这是所有逻辑时钟要刻画的对象。</li>\n<li><strong>逻辑计数 vs 向量</strong>：Lamport 时钟用单个计数器给出与因果一致的编号（O(1) 空间，但只能单向推断），向量时钟用每进程一个分量精确区分&quot;先后&quot;与&quot;并发&quot;（O(n) 空间）。</li>\n<li><strong>物理时间近似</strong>：HLC 与 TrueTime 在逻辑序之上重新引入物理时间信息，前者不需特殊硬件，后者靠 GPS + 原子钟把不确定性压到毫秒级。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话概括取舍：<strong>要判断并发就得付出 O(n) 的空间，要省空间就只能得到单向的因果保证，要精确的全局实时则需特殊硬件。</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"物理时钟的局限\">物理时钟的局限</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时钟漂移</td>\n<td>晶振频率微小差异</td>\n<td>节点间时间逐渐偏离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时钟跳变</td>\n<td>NTP 校时导致时间回退或跳跃</td>\n<td>依赖时间戳的逻辑出错</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络延迟不确定</td>\n<td>消息传输时间无法精确预知</td>\n<td>无法判断事件的绝对先后</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant A as Node A (T=100)&#10;  participant B as Node B (T=102)&#10;  A-&gt;&gt;B: 消息 (发送时 T_A=100)&#10;  Note over B: 收到时 T_B=103&#10;  Note over B: 消息延迟 = ? &lt;br/&gt; 1ms? 100ms?\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant A as Node A (T=100)\n  participant B as Node B (T=102)\n  A-&gt;&gt;B: 消息 (发送时 T_A=100)\n  Note over B: 收到时 T_B=103\n  Note over B: 消息延迟 = ? &lt;br/&gt; 1ms? 100ms?</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"lamport-时钟\">Lamport 时钟</h2><p>Leslie Lamport 于 1978 年提出的逻辑时钟算法：</p>\n<h3 id=\"规则\">规则</h3><ol>\n<li>每个进程维护一个计数器 C</li>\n<li>每次本地事件发生时，C = C + 1</li>\n<li>发送消息时，附带当前 C 值</li>\n<li>收到消息时，C = max(C, 消息中的 C) + 1</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Node A: C=1 → C=2 → send(msg, C=2) → C=3&#10;Node B: C=1 → receive(msg, C=2) → C=max(1,2)+1=3 → C=4\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Node A: C=1 → C=2 → send(msg, C=2) → C=3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Node B: C=1 → receive(msg, C=2) → C=max(1,2)+1=3 → C=4</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"性质\">性质</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>因果一致</td>\n<td>如果 a→b，则 C(a) &lt; C(b)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不可逆推</td>\n<td>C(a) &lt; C(b) 不能推出 a→b</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全序可扩展</td>\n<td>加入进程 ID 可构造全序</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class LamportClock:&#10;    def __init__(self, node_id: str):&#10;        self.time = 0&#10;        self.node_id = node_id&#10;&#10;    def tick(self) -&gt; int:&#10;        self.time += 1&#10;        return self.time&#10;&#10;    def send(self) -&gt; tuple[int, str]:&#10;        self.time += 1&#10;        return (self.time, self.node_id)&#10;&#10;    def receive(self, msg_time: int) -&gt; int:&#10;        self.time = max(self.time, msg_time) + 1&#10;        return self.time\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LamportClock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, node_id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.time </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.node_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.time </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self) -> tuple[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.time </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.time, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.node_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> receive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, msg_time: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.time </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.time, msg_time) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.time</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"向量时钟-vector-clock\">向量时钟（Vector Clock）</h2><p>向量时钟能准确判断两个事件是否存在因果关系或并发。</p>\n<h3 id=\"规则\">规则</h3><ol>\n<li>每个进程维护一个向量 V[0..n-1]（n 个进程）</li>\n<li>本地事件：V[自身] += 1</li>\n<li>发送消息：V[自身] += 1，附带 V</li>\n<li>接收消息：V[i] = max(V[i], V_msg[i]) 对所有 i，然后 V[自身] += 1</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Node A: [1,0,0] → [2,0,0] → send → [3,0,0]&#10;Node B: [0,1,0] → recv A[3,0,0] → [3,2,0]&#10;Node C: [0,0,1]                        ← 与 A、B 并发\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Node A: [1,0,0] → [2,0,0] → send → [3,0,0]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Node B: [0,1,0] → recv A[3,0,0] → [3,2,0]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Node C: [0,0,1]                        ← 与 A、B 并发</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"因果关系判断\">因果关系判断</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>比较</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>V(a) &lt; V(b)</td>\n<td>a 在 b 之前</td>\n<td>所有分量 ≤ 且至少一个 &lt;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V(a) = V(b)</td>\n<td>同一事件</td>\n<td>所有分量相等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V(a) || V(b)</td>\n<td>并发</td>\n<td>既不 &lt; 也不 &gt; 也不 =</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def is_before(v1: list[int], v2: list[int]) -&gt; bool:&#10;    return all(a &lt;= b for a, b in zip(v1, v2)) and any(a &lt; b for a, b in zip(v1, v2))&#10;&#10;def is_concurrent(v1: list[int], v2: list[int]) -&gt; bool:&#10;    return not is_before(v1, v2) and not is_before(v2, v1) and v1 != v2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> is_before</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v1: list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], v2: list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a, b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> zip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v1, v2)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a, b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> zip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v1, v2))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> is_concurrent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v1: list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], v2: list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is_before(v1, v2) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is_before(v2, v1) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v2</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"混合逻辑时钟-hlc\">混合逻辑时钟（HLC）</h2><p>HLC 结合了物理时钟和逻辑时钟的优势：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"HLC = (物理时间部分, 逻辑计数器部分)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>HLC = (物理时间部分, 逻辑计数器部分)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Lamport 时钟</th>\n<th>向量时钟</th>\n<th>HLC</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因果检测</td>\n<td>单向</td>\n<td>双向精确</td>\n<td>单向 + 时间近似</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物理时间信息</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用规模</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>中小规模</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class HLC:&#10;    def __init__(self):&#10;        self.pt = 0&#10;        self.lc = 0&#10;&#10;    def now(self, physical_time: int) -&gt; tuple[int, int]:&#10;        if physical_time &gt; self.pt:&#10;            self.pt = physical_time&#10;            self.lc = 0&#10;        else:&#10;            self.lc += 1&#10;        return (self.pt, self.lc)&#10;&#10;    def receive(self, msg_pt: int, msg_lc: int, physical_time: int) -&gt; tuple[int, int]:&#10;        if physical_time &gt; self.pt and physical_time &gt; msg_pt:&#10;            self.pt = physical_time&#10;            self.lc = 0&#10;        elif msg_pt &gt; self.pt:&#10;            self.pt = msg_pt&#10;            self.lc = msg_lc + 1&#10;        elif self.pt == msg_pt:&#10;            self.lc = max(self.lc, msg_lc) + 1&#10;        else:&#10;            self.lc += 1&#10;        return (self.pt, self.lc)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HLC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.lc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, physical_time: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> tuple[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> physical_time </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pt:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> physical_time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.lc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.lc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pt, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.lc)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> receive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, msg_pt: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, msg_lc: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, physical_time: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> tuple[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> physical_time </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> physical_time </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> msg_pt:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> physical_time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.lc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        elif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> msg_pt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pt:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> msg_pt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.lc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> msg_lc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        elif</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> msg_pt:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.lc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.lc, msg_lc) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.lc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pt, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.lc)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"truetime-google-spanner\">TrueTime（Google Spanner）</h2><p>Google Spanner 使用 GPS 和原子钟提供全球一致的时间接口：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"TT.now() → [earliest, latest]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>TT.now() → [earliest, latest]</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>误差范围</td>\n<td>通常 &lt; 7ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬件依赖</td>\n<td>GPS 接收器 + 原子钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现效果</td>\n<td>全球范围内的外部一致性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代价</td>\n<td>提交延迟 = 等待不确定性窗口关闭</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"实际系统的时钟选择\">实际系统的时钟选择</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>系统</th>\n<th>时钟方案</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Cassandra</td>\n<td>物理时间戳</td>\n<td>LWW 冲突解决</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DynamoDB</td>\n<td>向量时钟</td>\n<td>检测并发写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CockroachDB</td>\n<td>HLC</td>\n<td>无需特殊硬件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spanner</td>\n<td>TrueTime</td>\n<td>全球强一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>etcd/Raft</td>\n<td>日志索引</td>\n<td>共识协议内部序</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><ul>\n<li>不要依赖物理时钟做因果判断，NTP 精度不足以支撑分布式排序</li>\n<li>小规模系统可用向量时钟精确检测并发冲突</li>\n<li>大规模系统使用 HLC 在空间开销和因果追踪之间取得平衡</li>\n<li>如果业务必须依赖物理时间，确保 NTP 配置正确且监控时钟偏移</li>\n<li>Lamport 时钟适用于只需要全序而不需要并发检测的场景</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>分布式系统没有可依赖的全局物理时钟，因此事件排序必须建立在逻辑时钟之上。Lamport 时钟用 O(1) 空间给出与因果一致的全序，但无法区分&quot;先后&quot;与&quot;并发&quot;；向量时钟用 O(n) 空间换来精确的并发检测，代价是随节点数增长；HLC 折中了两者，以 O(1) 空间同时携带物理时间近似与逻辑序；TrueTime 则用 GPS + 原子钟的硬件代价换取全球外部一致性。选择取决于三条线：是否需要检测并发、能承受多大的空间开销、是否允许依赖特殊硬件。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分布式时钟与排序","id":"分布式时钟与排序"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"物理时钟的局限","id":"物理时钟的局限"},{"level":2,"text":"Lamport 时钟","id":"lamport-时钟"},{"level":3,"text":"规则","id":"规则"},{"level":3,"text":"性质","id":"性质"},{"level":2,"text":"向量时钟（Vector Clock）","id":"向量时钟-vector-clock"},{"level":3,"text":"规则","id":"规则"},{"level":3,"text":"因果关系判断","id":"因果关系判断"},{"level":2,"text":"混合逻辑时钟（HLC）","id":"混合逻辑时钟-hlc"},{"level":2,"text":"TrueTime（Google Spanner）","id":"truetime-google-spanner"},{"level":2,"text":"实际系统的时钟选择","id":"实际系统的时钟选择"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"一致性模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/fundamentals/consistency-models"},"next":{"title":"故障模型与容错","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/fundamentals/fault-models"}}